From 38eda5d7a2a66d7a6c89f59e0525abe67c0dfd29 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 19:45:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add stellar-tick diplomacy, war, and conquest system

- Add WarId, War domain object, DiplomaticStance enum on DiplomacyState
- Add Civilization.active_war_ids and Universe.wars index
- Add rules/diplomacy.py: WarDeclarationPolicy, PeacePolicy, AlliancePolicy
  with SpreadingPowerWarPolicy, ExhaustionPeacePolicy,
  SimilarDevelopmentAlliancePolicy defaults
- Add DiplomacyHandler (stellar): border detection, war declaration,
  peace resolution, mutual alliance formation
- Add WarHandler (stellar): per-tick exhaustion growth and probabilistic
  frontier system capture, tuned for stellar-tick cadence
  (capture_chance=0.01, exhaustion_per_tick=0.002) rather than the
  100x-slower interstellar cadence
- Wire both handlers into SimulationEngine.standard()'s stellar_handlers
- Add World.wars_involving() facade method
- Extend UniverseValidator with war referential-integrity checks
- Add WarDeclared/PeaceTreatySigned/AllianceFormed/SystemCaptured event
  formatters to sla_explorer render/civilizations.py, plus active war
  count on the civilization overview panel
